  "details": "The y position of objects placed under the avatars seems getting modified in the 1511 version.\n\nSome objects on my avatar was supposed to place under my foot. One placed under the floor, one placed upside it.\n\nIn the open beta 1511 version, those objects seem to be placed at the same height, which broke a major visual part of my avatar.\n\nSame uploaded avatar In the non-beta version, my avatar was placed at the correct position, which looks the same as I see in Unity editor.\n\nThis problem even affecting my avatar uploaded long time ago, not just newly uploaded avatar.\n\nI am not 100% sure is it really those objects height making my avatar looks different in 1511, but it didn't occurred before 1511.",
